  "_not_replies": "Subjects that are mail from an employer's careers site but not a reply to an application: job alerts, account welcomes, password resets. They come from the same sender as the receipt (donotreply@email.careers.microsoft.com sends all three), so the domain matcher pinned them on the application as 'unknown' replies (2026-10-01). Matched on the subject only, lowercase substring; such a mail is dropped, like a replies_exclude_from sender.",
